WEBVTT

00:27.380 --> 00:28.170
Huh?

00:48.580 --> 00:50.620
Oh, whew.

00:52.430 --> 00:54.340
It was just a dream.

00:55.170 --> 00:58.290
Boy, that was scary.

00:58.290 --> 01:01.230
Father had been killed.

01:01.230 --> 01:06.400
I wandered across battlefields
fighting men who were like monsters.

01:07.050 --> 01:09.500
And in the end, I became a slave.

01:17.340 --> 01:19.040
I'm glad I'm here.

01:27.120 --> 01:28.600
It's so peaceful.

01:44.240 --> 01:46.930
What's with this guy?

01:46.930 --> 01:49.350
H-He's so persistent.

01:49.350 --> 01:53.770
Stay down already!

01:57.420 --> 01:59.180
Damn it.

02:02.340 --> 02:06.800
What's wrong? I'll keep fighting.

02:08.410 --> 02:17.300
Let's find out if we're beneath you or not!

02:24.000 --> 02:26.480
I don't have time for this.

02:27.050 --> 02:31.010
Aw, man. I've had enough.

02:34.260 --> 02:36.270
You'd better prepare yourselves.

02:37.110 --> 02:43.180
You slaves have got some serious punishment
waiting for you after going this wild.

02:55.560 --> 02:58.030
We won.

04:34.100 --> 04:40.390
Oath

04:55.440 --> 04:56.600
Father!

05:01.500 --> 05:03.610
Listen to this.

05:03.610 --> 05:06.060
I just had a crazy dream.

05:07.000 --> 05:09.880
A bunch of arrows came flying, and you—

05:09.880 --> 05:12.130
I smell blood.

05:13.000 --> 05:13.920
Huh?

05:16.080 --> 05:17.700
Who did you kill...

05:19.940 --> 05:21.480
with that knife?

05:23.980 --> 05:24.840
What?

06:07.940 --> 06:10.240
It was to protect you.

06:13.000 --> 06:15.820
That strength was for protecting you.

06:18.970 --> 06:21.660
I'm sorry, Thorfinn.

06:23.300 --> 06:26.580
I still had things to tell you.

06:27.960 --> 06:31.620
There was still so much
I needed to teach you.

06:36.580 --> 06:39.940
No. Father...

06:42.670 --> 06:45.770
I... This is...

06:46.110 --> 06:47.560
I'm sorry...

06:46.860 --> 06:49.770
I did this!

06:50.360 --> 06:52.790
...for leaving you alone.

06:52.790 --> 06:57.450
Father, wait! Wait! Father!

07:00.800 --> 07:03.250
You understand now.

07:06.540 --> 07:08.700
You don't have any enemies.

07:09.370 --> 07:12.940
Nobody has any enemies.

07:30.440 --> 07:34.740
There's no one who it's okay to hurt.

07:37.320 --> 07:38.920
There never was.

09:04.920 --> 09:11.300
What is this place? Valhalla?

09:45.740 --> 09:47.140
They're laughing...

10:11.020 --> 10:12.120
Bjorn?

10:25.690 --> 10:30.880
Still stuck up there, huh, Thorfinn?

10:40.860 --> 10:44.390
Hey. It's been a while.

10:57.690 --> 11:00.080
Askeladd...

11:01.860 --> 11:05.750
You never learn, do you?

11:05.750 --> 11:08.030
You're already back here again?

11:12.200 --> 11:15.640
Is this Valhalla?

11:18.840 --> 11:21.380
What? Valhalla?

11:28.690 --> 11:30.920
You think this is the afterlife?

11:31.490 --> 11:33.540
You can't be serious.

11:34.130 --> 11:36.560
The afterlife is a much nicer place than this.

11:38.520 --> 11:39.770
Look carefully.

11:41.560 --> 11:44.560
This place is no different
from the world of the living.

11:47.220 --> 11:49.940
It's where all the shit gets dumped...

11:52.700 --> 11:56.040
Where all warriors wind up.

11:58.700 --> 12:01.360
It's the purest form of war.

12:04.530 --> 12:08.260
There is no victory. There is no end.

12:09.400 --> 12:13.780
In this place, everyone besides
yourself is your enemy.

12:17.120 --> 12:22.420
Everyone... is your enemy...

12:24.800 --> 12:27.530
Do you remember, Thorfinn?

12:28.050 --> 12:33.120
You used to live here with us.

12:34.690 --> 12:41.800
But for better or for worse, you became empty.

12:48.140 --> 12:52.280
That's why you were able
to escape this place.

12:54.930 --> 13:01.380
I shouldn't be saying this as the man
who dragged you here, but you're lucky.

13:02.450 --> 13:06.460
Not many men ever manage to escape.

13:09.400 --> 13:11.880
Just look at Bjorn.

13:16.780 --> 13:23.720
You were once filled with the idea of being
a warrior, but then you were emptied out.

13:25.400 --> 13:27.460
What's inside you now?

13:33.460 --> 13:37.760
I'm... still a warrior.

13:42.300 --> 13:44.760
I struck someone in a fit of rage.

13:45.620 --> 13:48.860
That's why I'm back here.

13:51.160 --> 13:53.500
I still reside in this place.

13:54.840 --> 13:58.950
My hands are about to give out, too.

14:00.900 --> 14:07.660
I'm pathetic. I never grow.

14:10.160 --> 14:12.850
Me, me, me.

14:12.850 --> 14:18.390
Good grief. A little soul-searching is all well
and good, but try to keep your eyes open.

14:22.860 --> 14:27.000
Something terrifying's
right beneath your feet.

14:44.420 --> 14:48.380
You're kicking them? How cruel.

14:49.600 --> 14:54.130
Shouldn't you lend an ear to their complaints?

14:54.830 --> 14:55.860
Complaints?

14:57.220 --> 14:59.990
That's right. Look closely.

14:59.990 --> 15:02.140
I'm sure you recognize some of those faces.

15:03.600 --> 15:09.120
They're all of the people you killed.

15:12.610 --> 15:13.390
What?

15:21.680 --> 15:22.840
I...

15:56.760 --> 16:01.760
You... All of you...

16:03.540 --> 16:08.080
I don't know who you are
or where you're from.

16:09.740 --> 16:18.960
I can't remember where or when I killed you.

16:45.860 --> 16:47.440
I'm sorry.

17:08.060 --> 17:12.860
Unbelievable. What an uncouth lot.

17:19.180 --> 17:23.050
Come on! You don't have time to cry.

17:23.050 --> 17:25.950
You don't want to fall back
down here, do you?

17:28.860 --> 17:31.960
Even if they're hanging off you, keep climbing!

17:32.620 --> 17:34.220
Climb!

17:39.460 --> 17:42.420
That's your battle.

17:51.260 --> 17:52.460
Go!

17:53.950 --> 17:56.910
Take the people you killed with you!

17:57.830 --> 18:00.650
Fight your true battle!

18:01.180 --> 18:03.840
Become a true warrior,

18:04.530 --> 18:06.100
Thorfinn!

18:52.600 --> 18:53.740
A dream?

18:58.060 --> 18:59.520
A true...

19:16.650 --> 19:18.700
Einar. Einar!

19:19.130 --> 19:21.130
Hey! Are you alive?

19:28.860 --> 19:30.240
Yeah.

19:32.130 --> 19:36.300
We won the fight.

19:44.330 --> 19:47.060
Man, we've hit rock bottom.

19:48.020 --> 19:54.420
We're drowning in debt, our wheat
has been ruined, and I'm a mess.

19:55.200 --> 19:59.370
On top of that, we'll be punished
for getting into that fight.

20:02.650 --> 20:09.450
But seeing you punch
that guy sure was satisfying.

20:12.100 --> 20:13.080
Ow...

20:15.850 --> 20:19.050
What's wrong? Are you in pain, too?

20:29.170 --> 20:39.080
Einar, I've used these hands
to kill so many people.

20:42.210 --> 20:45.240
People no different from your family...

20:47.410 --> 20:49.410
People whose names I didn't even know.

20:50.890 --> 20:53.180
People who I bore no grudge against.

21:04.380 --> 21:09.380
And today, I struck another person.

21:15.460 --> 21:17.090
But it ends now.

21:22.300 --> 21:25.570
I'll never hurt anyone again.

21:26.800 --> 21:30.280
As of today, I'm swearing off violence.

21:31.970 --> 21:33.450
I'm going to be reborn.

21:34.650 --> 21:38.300
I need to be reborn and
start atoning for what I've done.

21:57.880 --> 22:03.840
I'm going to fight my true battle.

22:07.440 --> 22:11.060
I see. All right.

22:12.130 --> 22:16.320
I don't really get it,
but I hear you loud and clear.

22:21.980 --> 22:23.540
I'm going to be reborn.

22:33.560 --> 22:37.180
They're not going to be punished?
That's ridiculous!

22:37.510 --> 22:41.930
Master, this matter concerns
order and discipline on the farm!

22:44.410 --> 22:49.190
Pater found this on the
ravaged farm this morning.

22:53.300 --> 22:57.030
By the way, Trygve,
where's that coat you always wear?

22:57.030 --> 22:59.570
Huh? What? Uh...

23:00.420 --> 23:04.890
The farm was ravaged by wild boars.
There was no fight.

23:04.890 --> 23:09.130
That's the story we're going with. Got it?

23:13.120 --> 23:16.180
Thank you, master.

23:17.440 --> 23:20.920
You're a strong man, Pater.

23:20.920 --> 23:24.980
You're not the slightest bit afraid of being
ostracized by the people you work with?

23:25.940 --> 23:27.800
I've been through a lot.

23:28.480 --> 23:30.880
After all, I used to be a slave.

23:32.970 --> 23:35.800
Loosen up or you'll wear yourself out.

23:36.540 --> 23:38.610
Let the weight of the hoe do the work.

23:42.040 --> 23:42.840
Yes, sir.

25:36.520 --> 25:39.900
The Cursed Head

25:37.480 --> 25:39.000
"The Cursed Head."
